      "text": "```\nDE INVENTIONE (On Invention, c. 87 BCE; early work)\n----------------------------------------------------\nCicero's earliest rhetorical treatise.\nSystematic treatment of inventio (finding arguments).\nLater Cicero was embarrassed by it (too schematic, too\nschoolbook) but it was the most-read rhetorical text\nin the medieval period."
    },
    {
      "id": "02-ROMAN-RHETORIC.md#015",
      "path": [
        "02-ROMAN-RHETORIC.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:rhetoric:02-roman-rhetoric, git-history:rhetoric:02-roman-rhetoric]",
        "canonical_path": "rhetoric/02-ROMAN-RHETORIC.md",
        "concepts": "[roman, rhetoric]",
        "current_path": "rhetoric/02-ROMAN-RHETORIC.md",
